    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "13. Terrain",
    "ruleNumber": "13.09",
    "summary": "Hidden is checked model by model. An **INFANTRY**, **BEASTS** or **SWARM** model is hidden while:\n\n- it is in a **terrain area** containing a light or dense feature\n- its unit has fired no ranged attacks this turn or the turn before (on the battle's opening turn, the turn-before test is met automatically)\n\nWhile hidden, it can be seen only by enemy models inside its **detection range**, ordinarily 15\". Resolve distance and sight using the general rules.",
